@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Component Diagram - Classroom Quiz
left to right direction

actor Teacher
actor Student

package "Next.js App (Node.js runtime)" {
	component "Teacher Portal" as TeacherClient
	component "Student Portal" as StudentClient
	component "API Routes / Application Services" as AppAPI
	component "Activity Phase Sync (SSE)" as ActivitySync
	component "Questions and Results" as QuizFlow
	component "Google Sheets Adapter (googleapis)" as SheetsAccess
	component "Writeback Worker" as WritebackWorker
}

database "Private Redis\n(server-only)" as ActivityData
cloud "Original Guided Notes Sheet" as GuidedNotes

Teacher --> TeacherClient : Import, control, review
Student --> StudentClient : Join group, submit
TeacherClient --> AppAPI : HTTPS actions
StudentClient --> AppAPI : HTTPS join / submit
AppAPI --> QuizFlow : Validate and execute commands
AppAPI --> SheetsAccess : Import / enqueue writeback
AppAPI --> ActivitySync : Open authenticated SSE
QuizFlow --> ActivityData : Atomic state + event Stream
ActivitySync --> ActivityData : Per-instance Stream reader
WritebackWorker --> ActivityData : Read / ack retryable jobs
SheetsAccess <--> GuidedNotes : Dynamic question/slot lookup and write
ActivitySync --> TeacherClient : Authorized live status / results
ActivitySync --> StudentClient : Phase / own receipt / post-close results

note bottom of ActivityData
	No browser connection to Redis.
	State transitions and event XADD are atomic.
end note

@enduml
